Define draw square,
    Set pen color to #89b4fa.
    Repeat 4 times,
        Move forward 100 steps.
        Turn right 90 degrees.
    End repeat.
End define.

Define draw triangle,
    Set pen color to #a6e3a1.
    Repeat 3 times,
        Move forward 100 steps.
        Turn right 120 degrees.
    End repeat.
End define.

Define draw circle,
    Set pen color to #f9e2af.
    Draw circle with radius 50.
End define.

Define draw star,
    Set pen color to #f38ba8.
    Repeat 5 times,
        Move forward 100 steps.
        Turn right 144 degrees.
    End repeat.
End define.

Open window with title Turtle Drawing.
Set window size to 520 by 560.
Set font size to 18.
Set text color to #89b4fa.
Add label Turtle Drawing.
Set font size to 12.
Set text color to #a6adc8.
Add label Pick a shape to draw.
Set text color to #cdd6f4.
Set font size to 13.
Add button with text Square that calls draw square.
Add button with text Triangle that calls draw triangle.
Add button with text Circle that calls draw circle.
Add button with text Star that calls draw star.
Wait for close.
